  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa Rehabilitacin Carreteras II Etapa</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Roads Rehabilitation Program, II Stage</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THIS PROGRAM IS A CONTINUATION OF PE-0025, FINANCED WITH BANK LOAN 651OC-PE. THIS SECOND STAGE CONTAINS ORDINARY MAINTAENANCE OF MAIN ROADS ANS THEIR BRIDGES, REHABILITATION AND IMPROVEMENT OF ABOUT 1,500 KM OF MAIN ROADS, AS WELL AS TECHNICAL, ECONOMIC AND EVIRONMENTAL STUDIES; THE PROGRAM INCLUDES WORKS AND MAINTENANCE SUPERVISION AND INSTITUTIONAL STRENGTHENING FOR THE EXECUTING AGENCY.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
